"update","title":"Trap Testers Demo - Update 1.04","summary":"Fourth update of the demo,And a massive one!New content:2 New maps3 New traps (including one new kind of trap)Win streak (flex in your lobby)Select in lobby how many traps you want to place per round2 New faces for your characterQoL:Improved UI when spectatingBrand new dive landingPlenty of new SFX and VFXNew \"In-Game\" status in the server browserNo more \"no one finished\"Access Settings from the lobbyCan place traps on torches in the DungeonNew cursor during trap selectionFixes:Fixed an issue wi","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-10-17T22:14:48Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1846651706685719","verified_at":"2026-10-20T23:08:58Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-5131730-1846018067941875","game_id":"steam-5131730","kind":"update","title":"Trap Testers Demo - Update 1.03","summary":"Third update of this demo!And we have finally updated all maps that were released with the demo!Here's the full changelog:Visual overhaul of SkyzoneNew path to show the wayNew SFX for traps and environmentTraps now have a default weightTwo rounds of traps if there are fewer than 4 players (soon to be a setting in lobby)Bug fixes and some QoL changes","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-10-12T17:45:48Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1846018067941875","verified_at":"2026-10-20T23:08:58Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-5131730-1846018067939357","game_id":"steam-5131730","kind":"update","title":"Trap Testers Demo - Update 1.02","summary":"Second update of this demo, and we are working hard to deliver you the updates you deserve!We updated Friend Slope for a second time, so that it is on par with deathrun_corridor.And this is only the beginning of what we updated!Here's the full changelog:New layouts for controller (and auto-detect!)New settings to edit the rate of trapsSensitivity settings are now more accurateNew trap (we will let you find out which one)Gameplay update for the DungeonFixed some bugs with the diveNew binds to sep","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-10-11T20:47:13Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1846018067939357","verified_at":"2026-10-20T23:08:58Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-5131730-1846018067932735","game_id":"steam-5131730","kind":"update","title":"Trap Testers Demo - Update 1.01","summary":"We are working hard on a big visual overhaul for the game!And with this update, we have already updated the visuals of 2 maps.That's not all. Here's the full changelog:Visual update for deathrun_corridorVisual update for Friend SlopeRevamped Friend Slope (more changes coming)A brand new visual for the spawn locationUpdated the aesthetics of the finish lineThanks to your feedback, we know what our priorities are.We are working hard on updating the visuals of the game, improving the \"less fun\" map","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-10-09T09:43:35Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1846018067932735","verified_at":"2026-10-20T23:08:58Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"}],"analyses":[],"news_status":{"steam-5131730":{"last_attempt_at":"2026-10-26T08:44:17Z","status":"ok","all_sources_checked_at":"2026-10-26T08:44:16Z","error_codes":[]}},"news_last_attempt_at":{"steam-5131730":"2026-10-26T08:44:17Z"},"notices":[],"news_sources":{"5131730":{"last_attempt_at":"2026-10-26T08:44:16Z","last_success_at":"2026-10-26T08:44:16Z","status":"ok","error_codes":[],"last_fulltext_checked_at":"2026-10-26T